    "detailed_description": "A casual cozy puzzle game where you create various dioramas.<br>Explore and assemble dioramas in a 3D environment.<br>Each diorama is made up of pieces and assembling them is one big puzzle.<br>Use the freedom to build from any location to create your own unique strategies.<br>Enjoy relaxing gameplay that allows you to create dioramas at your own pace with no time restraints.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/extras/ecedd2c165c35fa672f3cda1e4667963.avif?t=1697555136\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note From the Developer</h2>Each Diorama is built around different themes. <br>And like a rollercoaster ride some are calm while others are lively.<br>Each diorama is made up of pieces, and each diorama is a piece of a larger picture, <br>a wholesome experience which will hopefully leave you with a good feeling when completing the game. <br>I hope that anyone who enjoys puzzles and creating things will enjoy this game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2460640/extras/c31971efee59fe33fcfd79c716acdced.avif?t=1697555136\" /></span>",
